    "sections": {
        "description": "Thryve Corporate Dark is a modern Full Site Editing (FSE) WordPress theme designed for professional business use, including corporations, consulting firms, agencies, and service providers, offering a clean and refined design with fast performance and fully responsive layouts. Built entirely with Gutenberg blocks, it allows easy, code-free customization while ensuring brand consistency and scalability. With full WooCommerce compatibility, it supports corporate websites, service platforms, and eCommerce operations, making it a reliable and flexible solution for startups, growing companies, and established enterprises seeking a polished and professional online presence."
    },
